+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Commands
+
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or updates a Sokrates landscape report (`<analysisRoot>/_sokrates_landscape/index.html`), aggregating the results of multiple analyses found under `-analysisRoot`. It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands, and the same as `updateLandscape`.
+* `updateLandscape`: the same command as `analyzeLandscape`, kept so existing scripts keep working.
+
+Both accept the same options; run `java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -help` for details.
\ No newline at end of file
